# MACO Strike Team {G}: Creature — Human Soldier
#   Whenever a creature you control becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, create a tapped 1/1 red Officer creature token.
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets Bot1's Llanowar Elves, a creature Bot1 controls, so the Strike Team triggers and Bot1 gets a
# tapped 1/1 red Officer token. The Elves die to the Bolt, which has no bearing on the trigger.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
MACO Strike Team
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Forest
Lightning Bolt
Llanowar Elves
Yavimaya Hollow
Forest x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.MACO Strike Team.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
[Bot2.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Forest; MACO Strike Team; Officer Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Officer Token.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Officer Token.Power = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
